# IDNow's answer decides what happens next. A valid document with a matching face goes on to screening. An
# INVALID document is rejected and never screened. Anything in between (INCONCLUSIVE, a face mismatch, low
# confidence) asks for a retake, twice per market (config), then rejects.
#
# Image markers the IDNow simulator reacts to: INVALID, INCONCLUSIVE, FACE_MISMATCH, LOW_CONFIDENCE.

@onboarding = http://localhost:5100
@image = /9j/4EFUTEFTIFRFU1QgSU1BR0X/2Q==
@lowConfidence = /9j/4EFUTEFTIFRFU1QgSU1BR0UgTE9XX0NPTkZJREVOQ0X/2Q==
@invalid = /9j/4EFUTEFTIFRFU1QgSU1BR0UgSU5WQUxJRP/Z

### 1. A blurry selfie: 201 ACTION_REQUIRED, nextAction RETAKE_PHOTO.
# @name create
POST {{onboarding}}/v1/markets/MB/applications
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{
  "firstName": "Test",
  "lastName": "Tester",
  "dateOfBirth": "1990-01-01",
  "nationality": "XB",
  "countryOfResidence": "XB",
  "identifier": { "type": "NATIONAL_ID", "value": "9876543210987", "issuingCountry": "XB" },
  "email": "applicant@example.test",
  "phone": "+15550100100",
  "documents": [
    { "type": "PASSPORT", "image": "{{image}}" },
    { "type": "SELFIE", "image": "{{lowConfidence}}" }
  ],
  "termsAccepted": true
}

### 2. Only photos can change now; details get 409 application.onlyPhotos.
PATCH {{onboarding}}/v1/markets/MB/applications/{{create.response.body.applicationId}}
X-Application-Token: {{create.response.body.applicationToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "other@example.test" }

### 3. A new selfie (every version is kept).
PATCH {{onboarding}}/v1/markets/MB/applications/{{create.response.body.applicationId}}
X-Application-Token: {{create.response.body.applicationToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "documents": [ { "type": "SELFIE", "image": "{{image}}" } ] }

### 4. Submit again: 200 APPROVED.
POST {{onboarding}}/v1/markets/MB/applications/{{create.response.body.applicationId}}/submit
X-Application-Token: {{create.response.body.applicationToken}}

### 5. A forged document: 201 REJECTED straight away, and World-Check is never called.
POST {{onboarding}}/v1/markets/MB/applications
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{
  "firstName": "Test",
  "lastName": "Tester",
  "dateOfBirth": "1990-01-01",
  "nationality": "XB",
  "countryOfResidence": "XB",
  "identifier": { "type": "NATIONAL_ID", "value": "9876543210987", "issuingCountry": "XB" },
  "email": "applicant@example.test",
  "phone": "+15550100100",
  "documents": [
    { "type": "PASSPORT", "image": "{{invalid}}" },
    { "type": "SELFIE", "image": "{{image}}" }
  ],
  "termsAccepted": true
}
